# Vitu-Ghazi Inspector: the evidence is optional (CR 601.2b). With 6 mana value in the graveyard the option is offered; Bot1 casts without it, so the
# Inspector enters (a 1/3 with reach) and "if evidence was collected" is false (CR 603.4): nothing triggers, no target is asked for, Bot2's Ornithopter has no counter,
# no life is gained, and the graveyard is untouched.

